Combine ground beef, onion, and celery with a small amount of water in a saucepan.  Boil until all moisture is absorbed.  Mix beef mixture, rice, andmushroom soup; pour into a small greased casserole dish. Add salt and pepper.  Bake at 350F for 25 minutes; Microwave: Cook on Medium for 8 to 10 minutes;

Food Exchange per serving: 3 MEAT EXCHANGE + 2 STARCH/BREAD EXCHANGE CAL: 380

